  "details": "On Android beginning with the release from December 6, the game has been running slower by itself on my phone when it never had issues with it until these update versions. it used to be able to run 60fps fine in the home world, but as seen in the attachment, just looking in the mirror makes it go from 45FPS to 20 FPS. another thing is I'm not even in a demanding world, and with just 6 people on screen it goes down to 15FPS. I haven't had this trouble on my phone before, it's a Samsung Galaxy S10e. granted the fps has gotten slower before is cause I was in more demanding worlds with more people but this is unbearable.",
